WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Are you being too cautious?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,320
Xu Bo is a classmate after all

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,440
And you saved his life

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,840
As for being so defensive?

5
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,960
It's hard to say

6
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,720
What if they guess I have a lot of resources?

7
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,040
Becoming malicious

8
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,400
I don't want to take any risks

9
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,780
Then you let me go

10
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:13,900
What if something happens to me?

11
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,900
Don't worry, I was caught by them.

12
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:16,940
everything is up to me

13
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:17,940
I will use supplies then

14
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,260
redeem you with them

15
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:22,060
Then I really thank you, okay?

16
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,060
Who made me your best friend?

17
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,100
Life is not easy

18
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,220
abandon the road

19
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,220
if anyone asks

20
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,940
Just say this room is yours

21
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,920
You carry this dagger for self-defense

22
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,080
dog man

23
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,680
Treat this military girl as a child and a shield

24
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:37,550
Really abominable

25
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:39,910
I hope I can get some gold coins today.

26
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:40,950
Whether using drawings

27
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:42,510
It would be wiser to upgrade the windows

28
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:44,190
All require a lot of gold coins

29
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,390
Classmate Chen An

30
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,350
can i use silver coins

31
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:48,310
Let me exchange some wood with you

32
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:49,670
Why don't you go to the trading platform to change it?
